[[0,62693,0,2,0,2,"2015-03-12T21:17:46","MrBond","",[],"","Steam: Ubisoft Publisher Weekend Sale!","http://store.steampowered.com/sale/ubisoft_weekend/","GameDeals"],[1,91714,0,0,0,0,"2015-03-12T23:09:31","BrutalJones","[e]",[],"<p>This is cool and all but after the Unity fiasco I&#39;ll never give them another dime of my money. I was hyped as fuck for that game and it <em>still</em> doesn&#39;t run right on my rig. Poor framerate, floating textures, crashes. And I&#39;m running i7 4790, 16gb RAM, and 780ti SLI.</p>\n<p>If you are thinking of buying anything, I highly recommend Splinter Cell Blacklist, especially at that price point. That game is a hell of a lot of fun.</p>"],[2,91723,91714,0,0,0,"2015-03-12T23:25:03","MrBond","",[],"<p>I feel ya, actually just bought ACIII for $5 because I never finished it and don't want to go back to my PS3 just to play it.</p>"]]
